ion></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article><article class=\"tabber__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tabber-Bezerro\" aria-labelledby=\"tabber-Bezerro-label\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-gazelle-calf.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-gazelle-calf.png/130px-Creature-gazelle-calf.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-gazelle-calf.png/195px-Creature-gazelle-calf.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-gazelle-calf.png/260px-Creature-gazelle-calf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article></section></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Saúde</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Macho/Fêmea)</b>\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Bezerro)</b>\n</td>\n<td>?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Ataque</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Comportamento</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Alcance de alerta (m) (Macho/Fêmea)</b>\n</td>\n<td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Alcance de alerta (m) (Bezerro)</b>\n</td>\n<td>?\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Redmeat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Redmeat\">carne vermelha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Redmeat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Redmeat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>10 - 16<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Raw_hide\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Raw hide\">Pele crua grande</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Raw_hide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Raw hide\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 - 1.4<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fat\">Gordo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fat\" title=\"Fat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.7 - 1.3<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Animals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animals\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Animais</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><b>Gazelas</b> são um tipo de animal inofensivo encontrado no mundo em climas quentes e secos. Eles são uma fonte de carne vermelha, couro e gordura, mas matá-los pode ser difícil, pois podem localizar o jogador a uma distância muito longa.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Comportamentos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamentos</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Domesticação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Domesticação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Itens_obtidos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Itens obtidos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>As gazelas irão desovar em níveis de luz 10 e superiores, em temperaturas entre 20 e 90, e em áreas com menos de 0,5 de chuva e menos de 0,1 de floresta. Eles desovam em grupos médios de 6 indivíduos. Tecnicamente, os machos são a entidade que é gerada e as fêmeas e os bezerros são companheiros do macho.\n</p><p><span id=\"Behaviours\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamentos\">Comportamentos</span></h2>\n<p>Como a maioria dos animais, é comum ver as fêmeas perto dos machos e os filhotes perto das mães. Normalmente você os encontrará vagando, a menos que se aproxime a menos de 30 quarteirões deles. Então eles fugirão.\n</p><p><span id=\"Domestication\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Domestica.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Domesticação\">Domesticação</span></h2>\n<p>As gazelas não podem ser domesticadas.\n</p><p><span id=\"Drops\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Itens_obtidos\">Itens obtidos</span></h2>\n<p><abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">Açougueiro</abbr> o animal clicando com o botão direito enquanto se agacha com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span> na mão ativa para colher seu cadáver.\n</p>\n<ul><li>10-16 carnes vermelhas cruas</li>\n<li>1-2 pele crua (grande)</li>\n<li>0-2 gordura</li>\n<li>Sem ossos</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Entidades</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Passivo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">Borboleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Deer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Deer\">Veado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\">Gazela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gazelle\" title=\"Gazelle\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Goat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Goat\">Cabra</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Goat\" title=\"Goat\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hare\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hare\">Lebre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hare\" title=\"Hare\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Salmon\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Salmon\">Salmão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Salmon\" title=\"Salmon\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Neutra</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\