osa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fox\" title=\"Fox\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hyena\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hyena\">Hiena</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Immobilized_eidolon\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Immobilized eidolon\">Eidolon imobilizado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Immobilized_eidolon\" title=\"Immobilized eidolon\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Locust\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Locust\">Locuste</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Locust\" title=\"Locust\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Shiver\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Shiver\">Arrepio</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Shiver\" title=\"Shiver\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\">Lobo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Gui